### ---------- V3. GET /api/reservations/{reservationId} - Get Reservation Detail ----------

### V3.1 Id ton tai -> 200/1, tra ReservationDetailDTO
# BAY LON: phai co object "room" NESTED (lay tu RoomService), KHONG co "roomId".
# Expect: room.roomNumber="A-101", room.capacity=2, status="CONFIRMED"
GET {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1

### V3.2 Id khong ton tai -> 404/4 "Reservation is not found"
GET {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/999999

### V3.3 Id sai kieu -> 406/2
GET {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/abc


### ---------- V2. PUT /api/reservations/{reservationId} - Update Reservation ----------

### V2.1 Partial update -> 200/1, tra ReservationDTO PHANG (co roomId), field khac giu nguyen
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "Da Doi Ten" }

### V2.2 Update status -> 200/1
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CHECKED_IN" }

### V2.3 Update ngay -> 200/1 va totalAmount phai TINH LAI theo so dem moi
# 10/09 -> 15/09 = 5 dem x 850000 = 4250000
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkInDate": "10/09/2026", "checkOutDate": "15/09/2026" }

### V2.4 Id khong ton tai -> 404/4 "Reservation ID is not found"
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "X" }

### V2.5 status ngoai enum -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "BROKEN" }

### V2.6 checkOut truoc checkIn -> 406/2 (check SAU khi merge partial)
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checkInDate": "20/09/2026", "checkOutDate": "10/09/2026" }

### V2.7 guestName 101 ky tu -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX" }

### V2.8 Email sai format -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestEmail": "sai-email" }

### V2.9 numberOfGuests = 0 -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "numberOfGuests": 0 }

### V2.10 Doi sang roomId khong ton tai -> 404/4
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": 999999 }

### V2.11 guestName chuoi rong -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "" }

### V2.12 Id sai kieu -> 406/2
PUT {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{ "guestName": "X" }


### ---------- V4. DELETE /api/reservations/{reservationId} - Cancel Reservation ----------

### V4.1 Huy -> 200/1, data NULL, message "Reservation cancelled successfully"
DELETE {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1

### V4.2 Get lai -> status = CANCELLED, row VAN CON
GET {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/1

### V4.3 Id khong ton tai -> 404/4
DELETE {{reservationUrl}}/api/reservations/999999
